      "index": 1,
      "text": "Let’s Move Forward Together",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Connect with SDG Railway for sustainable, efficient, and digital rail logistics across the Mediterranean network. Whether you’re looking for transport solutions, partnerships, or educational collaborations, our team is ready to assist you.",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "###\n\nContact Information\n\nHead Office:\n\nIntermodal Hub – Barcelona, Spain\n\nEmail:\n\ncontact@sdgrailway.com\n\nPhone:\n\n+34 93 000 000\n\nWebsite:\n\nwww.sdgrailway.com\n\n###\n\nOur Network\n\n###\n\nSDG Railway operates across Europe, the Mediterranean, and North Africa through strategic intermodal hubs in Barcelona, Lyon, Verona, Cairo, and Amman.",
